  "notes": "Paste-on back cover, printed in U.S.A.\nIssued with \"From the Atlantic Catalog\" company inner sleeve, cat. #s A1 to A3, printed by [l=Queens Litho] in U.S.A.\n\nTracks A1, A3, A6, B1, B4 to B6 were recorded at Atlantic Recording Studios, New York, N.Y.\nTracks A2, A3, A5, B2 & B3 were recorded at Criteria Studios, Miami, Florida.\n\nHubert Laws appears on this album through the courtesy of [url=https://www.discogs.com/label/904-AM-Records]A & M Records[/url].\n\n℗ 1972 Atlantic Recording Corporation [back cover]\n℗ 1972 Atlantic [labels]\n\nTrack publishers:\nA1: Nootrac, BMI\nA2, A3, A5, B3: Pundit, BMI\nA4: Ninandy, BMI\nA6: Assorted/Parabut, BMI\nB1: Blue Seas/Jac/April, ASCAP\nB2: East/Time, BMI\nB4: Maclen, BMI\nB5: Nickel Shoe/Bell Boy, BMI\nB6: Dick James, BMI\n\nAll runouts are etched.",
